---
code: field.name.snake-case
description: Convert camelCase field names to snake_case / underscore (userName -> user_name)
default-enabled: false
---

# Mirrors Jackson's SnakeCaseStrategy. Snake case and underscore naming
# produce the same result, so both are covered by this single extension.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.camel2Underline(it.fieldName())
```
